```Title: EventLog Service or Log Channel Disabled in the Registry (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1685.001 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 88599209-9ceb-4d1b-a650-794adc918098```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 13 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Windows and software installers disabling noisy analytic / debug channels```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13
((TargetObject="*\\Services\\EventLog\\Start" Details="DWORD (0x00000004)") OR (TargetObject="*\\WINEVT\\Channels\\*" TargetObject="*\\Enabled" Details="DWORD (0x00000000)"))
| table _time host User Image EventType TargetObject Details
